8. The dropout rate was set to 0.25, which means that 25% of the neurons will be randomly dropped out during training.
9. The weight decay regularization term was included in the loss function to prevent overfitting.
10. The early stopping criterion was used to stop training once the validation loss stopped improving for a certain number of epochs.
11. The model was evaluated on the test set after every epoch to monitor its performance.
12. The best model was chosen based on the highest accuracy score achieved on the test set.

